{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"openURL","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Read this environment value to get an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance for a given ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"text":". Call the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance to open a URL. You call the instance directly because it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defines a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" method that Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls when you call the instance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, you can open a web site when the user taps a button:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["struct OpenURLExample: View {","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openURL","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            if let url = URL(string: \"https:\/\/www.example.com\") {","                openURL(url)","            }","        } label: {","            Label(\"Get Help\", systemImage: \"person.fill.questionmark\")","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to know whether the action succeeds, add a completion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler that takes a Boolean value. In this case, Swift implicitly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead. That method calls your completion handler after it determines"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it can open the URL, but possibly before it finishes opening"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the URL. You can add a handler to the example above so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it prints the outcome to the console:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["openURL(url) { accepted in","    print(accepted ? \"Success\" : \"Failure\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system provides a default open URL action with behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that depends on the contents of the URL. For example, the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action opens a Universal Link in the associated app if possible,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or in the user’s default web browser if not."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also set a custom action using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View\/environment(_:_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view modifier. Any views that read the action from the environment,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including the built-in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Link"},{"type":"text","text":" view and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" views with markdown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links, or links in attributed strings, use your action. Initialize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action by calling the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" initializer with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a handler that takes a URL and returns an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["Text(\"Visit [Example Company](https:\/\/www.example.com) for details.\")","    .environment(\\.openURL, OpenURLAction { url in","        handleURL(url) \/\/ Define this method to take appropriate action.","        return .handled","    })"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI translates the value that your custom action’s handler"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns into an appropriate Boolean result for the action call."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, a view that uses the action declared above"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" when calling the action, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler always returns "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result\/handled"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV7openURLAA0A9URLActionVvp","title":"openURL","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"openURL","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/openurl"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/openURL","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that opens a URL."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"EnvironmentValues","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declare a property using the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" property wrapper and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specify the value’s key path. For example, you can read the current locale:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentVal